/****** UP-Button.mcc/UPA_Button_IconData ******
*
*   NAME
*       UPA_Button_IconData -- attribute of UP-Button.mcc
*
*   FUNCTION
*       Struct UP_IconData*: caller icon for a glyph not in the set; used when UPA_Button_Icon names none. The struct and its mask are NOT copied: they must stay valid until the object is disposed
*
*   INPUTS
*       UPA_Button_IconData - access I. Tag value from <mcc/up.h>.
*
*   RESULT
*       Read with GetAttr/get(), set with SetAttrs/set() or in the MUI_NewObject tag list, as the access letters allow (I = initial, S = set, G = get).
*
*   SEE ALSO
*       <mcc/up.h>, UP-Button.mcc
*
******/
